  "title": "Dak Dori Tang (Spicy Korean Chicken Stew)",
  "description": "Chicken is marinated with gochujang (chile paste), ginger, and garlic, then simmered with vegetables in a simple, full-flavored Korean stew.",
  "authors": [
    "PolkaDot"
  ],
